  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: be24dda36ecc6a74497f9aca3439b749, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GraduationDemo.Train.TrainObservation
  title: Talk to the businessman
  description: Good afternoon, detective. I can spare a moment. What would you like
    to discuss?
  speaker: {fileID: 1962546295948733137}
  interactionRange: 3.25
  topics:
  - Introduce yourself
  - The carnival
  - This carriage
  responses:
  - I prefer a quiet journey and a well-kept schedule. A comfortable compartment
    is a welcome bonus.
  - An extravagant occasion, by all accounts. I shall reserve judgment until I have
    seen it for myself.
  - The suite offers a little peace. You are welcome to ask your questions, provided
    we keep the conversation civil.
